      "shortDescription": "REICH develops and manufactures coupling systems and power-transmission components in Bochum. Its official portfolio covers highly flexible, torsionally flexible and torsionally rigid couplings for industrial, mobile, marine, power-generation and test-bench applications.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "Official company material identifies Dipl.-Ing. Herwarth Reich GmbH as a German coupling manufacturer founded in 1946 and based in Bochum. REICH develops and manufactures coupling systems with in-house production and testing capabilities for power-transmission applications.",
        "The documented range includes highly flexible rubber-disc and coupling-shaft systems, flexible claw and pin-type couplings, tyre couplings, torsionally rigid flange and full-metal couplings and engineered docking systems. Published applications cover pump and compressor drives, power generation, engine and electric-motor test benches, marine equipment, rail, construction and agricultural machinery and general industrial drives."
